{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01Y3AV36WS9MZcHBnm2aNG8s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## ROOT CAUSE DOCUMENTATION\n\n### Issue: False character merge: \"the mummer\" merged with \"Prince Prospero\"\n\n**Symptom:** \"the mummer\" is listed as an alias of Prince Prospero in HTML output, but it refers to the Red Death personification\n\n**Data flow trace:**\n1. Appears in: `output/masque_of_red_death/report.html`\n2. Stored in: `AnalysisResult.characters` (from CharacterMap)\n3. Generated by: `CharacterConsensusBuilder.build_character_map()`\n4. **Originates in:** `src/pipeline/character_extraction/consensus.py:_llm_cross_group_resolution()` lines 1954-2031\n\n**Root cause:** \nThe `_format_contexts()` function (lines 733-795) samples contexts using narrative spread (early/middle/late) and chapter diversity. It does NOT prioritize showing contexts where the epithet and proper name **co-occur** or **interact**. The LLM is being asked \"does 'the mummer' refer to 'Prince Prospero'?\" but is NOT being shown the scenes where they CONFRONT each other. The prompt includes conflict detection instructions, but the evidence of conflict is not in the provided context snippets.\n\n**Confidence:** HIGH\n\n## SOLUTION APPROACH\n\nBased on the evaluation state recommendation and failed approach analysis, I will implement a **pre-filter that detects confrontation/interaction patterns** before the epithet is sent to LLM for cross-group resolution.\n\nThe approach:\n1. Add a function `_entities_in_confrontation()` that checks if an epithet and proper name appear in sentences with confrontation verbs\n2. Call this check in `_llm_cross_group_resolution()` BEFORE adding matches to the result\n3. Skip the match if confrontation is detected\n\nLet me implement this:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":694,"cache_read_input_tokens":45591,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":694,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bd8b482e-9533-45db-8854-fa9612acdb55","uuid":"a10ffbde-6b2a-49e7-988b-86f200797874"}
